### Step 2: Create Phase Files
Generate detailed step files for each phase. Use the templates below.

## Phase File Templates

### 01-db-updates.md

```markdown
# Phase 1: Database Updates

## Status: ⬜ Pending

## Overview
[Brief description of database changes]

## Planned Changes
- [ ] Create table: `[table_name]`
- [ ] Add columns to existing table: `[table_name].[column_name]`
- [ ] Create RLS policies for: `[table_name]`
- [ ] Create indexes: `[index_name]`
- [ ] Generate TypeScript types: `npm run update-types`

## Migration SQL

```sql
-- Migration: [timestamp]_[description].sql

-- 1. Create table
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.[table_name] (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW() NOT NULL,
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW() NOT NULL,
  user_id UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  
  -- Feature-specific columns
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  description TEXT,
  status TEXT DEFAULT 'draft' CHECK (status IN ('draft', 'pending', 'active', 'completed'))
);

-- 2. Enable RLS
ALTER TABLE public.[table_name] ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

-- 3. RLS Policies
CREATE POLICY "[table_name]_select_own"
  ON public.[table_name]
  FOR SELECT
  USING (auth.uid() = user_id);

CREATE POLICY "[table_name]_insert_own"
  ON public.[table_name]
  FOR INSERT
  WITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);

CREATE POLICY "[table_name]_update_own"
  ON public.[table_name]
  FOR UPDATE
  USING (auth.uid() = user_id);

CREATE POLICY "[table_name]_delete_own"
  ON public.[table_name]
  FOR DELETE
  USING (auth.uid() = user_id);

-- 4. Indexes
CREATE INDEX idx_[table_name]_user_id ON public.[table_name](user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_[table_name]_status ON public.[table_name](status);
CREATE INDEX idx_[table_name]_created_at ON public.[table_name](created_at DESC);
```

## Rollback SQL

```sql
-- Rollback: [timestamp]_[description].sql
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS public.[table_name] CASCADE;
```

## Seed Data

```sql
-- seed.sql (append to existing)
INSERT INTO public.[table_name] (user_id, title, status)
VALUES 
  ('user-uuid-here', 'Sample Item 1', 'active'),
  ('user-uuid-here', 'Sample Item 2', 'draft');
```

