## Output Checklist
After creating step files, verify:
- [ ] Index file exists: `docs/[feature-name]/00-index.md`
- [ ] All phase files created: `01-db-updates.md`, `02-api-updates.md`, etc.
- [ ] Each file has clear verification checklist
- [ ] Code examples are complete and ready to implement
- [ ] Status tracking is set up

## Next Step
Once step files are created, proceed to **Implement Step** using the `implement-step.mdc` rule, starting with Phase 1.

## Context Preservation
When stopping after this step:
- All planning is complete in the `docs/[feature-name]/` folder
- The `00-index.md` tracks overall progress
- Each phase file is self-contained with full context
- Resume by reading `00-index.md` to see current status
